        "collapsible_tab_3XrnC6": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Specifications",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<ul><li>Complete organic sleep system: Pillow Top mattress, SnoozeLift 5.0 base, 2 Kloud pillows, Breezeline sheet set, and a mattress protector</li><li>Sizes: Queen, King, California King, Split King</li><li>Mattress: Pillow Top by Gary Brecka, 4\" organic latex layer, 1,100 pocketed coils</li><li>Base: SnoozeLift 5.0 with head and foot positioning, remote control, massage setting</li><li>Every component matched to your selected size and designed to work together</li><li>100-night trial and 30-year warranty on the mattress</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 40,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 32,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_mkpMmw": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Every layer is clean and certified. The Pillow Top mattress uses an ORGANIC-AIR cotton cover, CLOUDWOOL fire barrier (naturally flame-safe, no chemicals or fiberglass), organic latex, and a five-zone SupportWave coil system. The Kloud pillows are a 50/50 blend of organic kapok and natural latex shreds. The Breezeline sheets are organic cotton with a cooling weave. The protector pairs an ORGANIC-AIR organic cotton layer with a MoistureGuard plant-based waterproof barrier. No petroleum foams, no VOC off-gassing, no synthetic fillers.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 0,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_9UMbgc": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Buy the Bundle?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<ul><li>A complete organic sleep system in one order, matched by size</li><li>Save $2,400, over 30% versus buying each piece separately</li><li>Adjustable base lifts head and legs for open airway, circulation, and recovery</li><li>Plush 4\" latex pillow top for deep pressure relief, ideal for side sleepers</li><li>Clean and chemical-free from the coils to the pillowcase</li><li>FREE White Glove set-up and delivery included—a $299 value with all mattress bundles</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
